# Faded vintage bed rug (issue 166): putty field with a row of worn taupe and dusk diamonds along the long sides, a pale border, worn flecks; mirrored top to bottom and left to right. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 7x3 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 112x48
